"""Editorial "Best of the year" guides: the strongest new movies, shows, anime, games and books of one year.

Content only; app/best_of.py and app/routers/best_of.py turn it into pages.
A guide covers one format in one year and is updated as the year goes on, so
"reviewed" moves forward while the URL stays the same. Every pick names where and
when it came out, why it made the list, and a caveat, and every guide lists the
public reviews and listings its facts were checked against.

Guide fields: format (URL segment), kind (title_pages.KINDS key), year, name,
search_title, summary, reviewed, lead (paragraphs), picks, also (shorter
mentions: (title, sentence)), coming (paragraphs about dated releases still to
come, may be empty), start (paragraphs), related ((label, path) to other guides),
sources ((label, url)).

Pick fields: kind, title, year (the release year OmniTrackr files it under),
creator (director or author; None for TV, anime and games), released (where and
when, in a few words), why (stands on its own, also shown by Pick for me), note
(why it made the list), caveat.
"""

